# Backend origin the Next server proxies /api/v1/* to (no trailing slash).
# The dashboard client always calls same-origin relative /api/v1/* paths, so
# the httpOnly auth cookies stay first-party. This server-side variable makes
# Next forward those calls to the backend (next.config.ts rewrite; read when
# the server config is loaded — `pnpm dev` startup, or `next build` for the
# Docker image). Deployed environments (dev/prd) leave it UNSET: Caddy
# proxies /api/v1 on the app domain to the backend.
API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8080
